Empire in their hands!

00:22:41.060 --> 00:22:44.096
Will this work? Can they really win?

00:22:44.463 --> 00:22:45.865
Can we win?

00:22:46.599 --> 00:22:47.433
Of course we can.

00:22:47.933 --> 00:22:50.236
