00:22:50.903 --> 00:22:53.906
If we don't win now, who will?

00:22:54.506 --> 00:22:56.575
That's right! We've gotta win!

00:22:56.942 --> 00:22:58.043
Naturally!

00:22:58.878 --> 00:23:00.045
Nah-na-la!

00:23:00.412 --> 00:23:02.281
In the name of the God of Babylon!

00:23:03.382 --> 00:23:05.551
So don't worry, Beauty.

00:23:07.019 --> 00:23:09.321
